$$
-\frac{7}{6} - \frac{9}{8} - \frac{5}{6} = \left(-\frac{7}{6} - \frac{5}{6}\right) - \frac{9}{8} = -\frac{12}{6} - \frac{9}{8} = -2 - \frac{9}{8} = -\frac{25}{8}
$$

